values ('openai-official-news', 'rss', 'https://openai.com/news/rss.xml', 'OpenAI', 'Official news', 'en', 'OpenAI is the AI lab behind ChatGPT. This is its official news feed: model and product launches such as GPT-6 Astra, customer case studies with companies like Cooley and Hex, safety and alignment framework updates, and new ChatGPT features for work, legal and financial services. Research papers and developer changelogs are published elsewhere.', 14.6, null, null, '["How Cooley is accelerating IPO work with ChatGPT","Introducing Astra for Law","Helping older adults use AI in everyday life"]')
