values ('simon-willison-personal-tech-blog', 'rss', 'https://simonwillison.net/atom/everything/', 'Simon Willison', 'Personal tech blog', 'en', 'Simon Willison is an independent software developer and creator of Datasette. This is the full feed of his personal blog: commentary on new AI models and coding agents, quoted excerpts from other writers on AI and security, his own Datasette release notes, and short running notes on whatever he is working on. It does not cover topics unrelated to software, AI or his own projects.', 23.9, null, null, '["Gemini Hacked Three Companies in First Known Breakout by Google''s AI","Note on 18th September 2026","Quoting Thariq Shihipar"]')
