values ('tim-urban-personal-essays-blog', 'rss', 'https://waitbutwhy.com/feed', 'Tim Urban', 'Personal essays blog', 'en', 'Tim Urban is the writer behind the Wait But Why blog. This is its feed: long personal essays and illustrated posts on travel, parenting, technology and his own life, such as trips to Bhutan, becoming a father, and trying the Vision Pro headset. It is personal long form writing, not news, and does not follow current events.', 0, null, null, '["The sights and sounds of Bhutan","Tales from Toddlerhood","All My Thoughts After 40 Hours in the Vision Pro"]')
