values ('google-google-workspace-product-updates', 'website', 'https://workspaceupdates.googleblog.com/', 'Google', 'Google Workspace product updates', 'en', 'Google is the technology company behind Google Workspace, including Gmail, Docs and Gemini productivity tools. This is the Workspace Updates blog: recap posts summarizing recent changes, new Gemini Notebook features for schools and organizations, and workflow automation additions to Workspace Studio. It does not cover Google products outside Workspace, such as Search or Android.', 35, null, null, '["Google Workspace Weekly Recap - September 18, 2026","New back-to-school features and learning tools available in Gemini Notebook","Notebooks in Gemini: a dedicated workspace for focused, organized work, now for schools and organizations"]')
