values ('anthropic-company-announcements', 'website', 'https://www.anthropic.com/news', 'Anthropic', 'Company announcements', 'en', 'Anthropic is an AI safety and research company that makes the Claude models. This is its newsroom: safety and alignment updates such as its work with METR, partnerships like the one with Accenture on embedded evaluation, new safeguard and verification programs for enterprise and life sciences customers, and executive hires. It does not cover Claude model release notes or developer documentation in detail.', 1.6, null, null, '["Partnering with Accenture on embedded evaluation","Introducing the Life Sciences Verification Program","Improving our alignment and security efforts"]')
