values ('melty-labs-changelog', 'rss', 'https://www.conductor.build/changelog/rss.xml', 'Melty Labs', 'Changelog', 'en', 'Melty Labs is the Y Combinator backed company that makes Conductor, a tool for running teams of coding agents in the cloud. This is its changelog feed: version by version release notes covering new coding models added such as GPT-6 Astra and Claude Fable 5.1, cloud workspace features, and interface changes like search and sidebar sections. It does not cover company news or customer stories.', 1.8, null, null, '["Conductor 0.87.0: Search across files, OpenCode 2.0","Conductor 0.86.0: Share your loadouts","Conductor 0.85.0: Sections, routines, and a new model picker"]')
