values ('fc-barcelona-first-team-news', 'website', 'https://www.fcbarcelona.com/en/football/first-team/news', 'FC Barcelona', 'First team news', 'en', 'FC Barcelona is the Spanish football club''s official channel. This is its first team news section: match previews and reports, player interviews and quotes such as with Raphinha and Lamine Yamal, squad and injury updates, and club record and milestone posts. It does not cover the club''s other sports sections such as basketball or handball, or transfer rumours from outside sources.', 52.5, null, null, '["Barça players called up for international duty","When and where to watch Sevilla v Barça","Flick: ''We''re focused on our own job''"]')
