values ('latent-space-ai-engineering-newsletter-and-podcast', 'rss', 'https://www.latent.space/feed', 'Latent Space', 'AI engineering newsletter and podcast', 'en', 'Latent Space is an AI engineer newsletter and technical podcast. This is its feed: daily AI news roundups, interviews with founders and researchers such as at AIUC and Recursive, and deep dives on topics like forward deployed engineering and frontier model launches. It does not cover general consumer tech, it stays focused on how AI labs and engineers actually build.', 7.5, null, null, '["[AINews] not much happened today","[AINews] Reality Checks on AI News (Yegge shuts down Gas Town, Databricks'' +60% Astra cost)","Underwriting Superintelligence: Backing Agents you can Sue - Rune Kvist, AIUC"]')
