values ('mundo-deportivo-fc-barcelona', 'rss', 'https://www.mundodeportivo.com/feed/rss/futbol/fc-barcelona', 'Mundo Deportivo', 'FC Barcelona', 'es', 'Mundo Deportivo is a Barcelona based sports daily. This is its FC Barcelona feed: first team match reports and quotes from players like Raphinha and Lamine Yamal, plus coverage of the club''s women''s football and futsal sections, referee assignments and club assembly and stadium news. It does not cover other clubs except as Barça''s opponents or rivals.', 253.6, null, null, '["6-1: Barça treats itself to a feast at the Palau","Raphinha: ''I plan to renew and hopefully finish my career at Barça''","Romeu highlights the ''huge ease Pina has to load up her shot''"]')
