values ('sport-fc-barcelona-transfer-market', 'website', 'https://www.sport.es/es/temas/fichajes-fc-barcelona-19851', 'Sport', 'FC Barcelona transfer market', 'es', 'Sport is a Barcelona-based sports daily. This is its FC Barcelona transfer tag: confirmed signings and rumours involving the club, recently covering Gabriel Jesus joining as a forward, Rodri''s move from Manchester City, and talks over Julian Alvarez. It also tracks youth scouting, including a Norwegian teenager. It does not cover match reports or league results.', 6.9, null, null, '["Barcelona scouted Bo Hegland, another great Norwegian talent","Official: Barcelona sign young Italian scorer Giulia Galli","Gabriel Jesus and his move to FC Barcelona"]')
