values ('the-verge-general-tech-news', 'rss', 'https://www.theverge.com/rss/index.xml', 'The Verge', 'General tech news', 'en', 'The Verge is a technology and culture publication founded in 2011. This is its main feed: breaking tech and policy news, gadget reviews and deals, entertainment stories, and podcast episodes, spanning AI safety debates, Disney naming its first chief technology officer, iPhone camera design, and handheld gaming devices. It is the full breadth of Verge coverage, not one narrow beat.', 261.1, null, null, '["OpenAI and Microsoft knew they were starting a doom loop for the web","Disney''s first CTO is Character.AI''s former CEO","Gavin Newsom is pushing for an AI kill switch"]')
