values ('barca-universal-fc-barcelona-news', 'rss', 'https://barcauniversal.com/barca-news/feed/', 'Barca Universal', 'FC Barcelona news', 'en', 'Barca Universal is an independent news site covering FC Barcelona, not affiliated with the club. This is its main news stream: player interviews with figures such as Lamine Yamal and Raphinha, transfer stories including a Manchester United youngster''s visit to Barcelona, and reactions from opposing managers ahead of league matches. It focuses entirely on Barcelona, not other clubs.', 249.5, null, null, '["Lamine Yamal clear about his career ambitions","Confirmed: Barcelona starlet receives maiden national team call-up","Just in: Real Madrid target in Barcelona over potential move as Man United exit nears"]')
