values ('barca-blaugranes-fc-barcelona-news', 'rss', 'https://www.barcablaugranes.com/rss/index.xml', 'Barca Blaugranes', 'FC Barcelona news', 'en', 'Barca Blaugranes is an independent news site covering FC Barcelona, not affiliated with the club. This is its main news stream: player interviews with Lamine Yamal and Raphinha, transfer news such as a Manchester United academy player arriving in Barcelona, injury updates, and opinion pieces ranking the club''s great teams. It focuses solely on Barcelona, not other clubs.', 140, null, null, '["Reminds me of Pedri - Xavi Espart hailed by Spain boss","JJ Gabriel arrives in Barcelona after asking to leave Man Utd","Lamine Yamal reveals Barcelona''s Champions League weak points"]')
