values ('mem0-ai-agent-memory', 'website', 'https://mem0.ai/blog', 'Mem0', 'AI agent memory', 'en', 'Mem0 is a company building a memory layer for AI agents. This is its blog: product announcements such as joining the Vercel Marketplace and a memory consolidation feature called Dream, engineering write-ups on cutting vector search latency and reducing Claude Code''s memory footprint, and comparisons against OpenAI Memory and LangMem. It focuses on agent memory rather than general AI news.', 1.6, null, null, '["Mem0 joins Vercel Marketplace","Give Every Agent Exactly The Tools It Needs","What Is Memory Staleness in AI? Causes, Risks and Solutions"]')
