values ('mistral-ai-company-news', 'rss', 'https://mistral.ai/rss.xml', 'Mistral AI', 'Company news', 'en', 'Mistral AI is a French artificial intelligence lab that builds open weight language models. This is its blog: model and product launches, enterprise and government partnerships, funding announcements, and posts on sovereign and open AI infrastructure in Europe. It carries Mistral''s own announcements rather than independent research analysis or outside commentary.', 0.9, null, null, '["Mistral and Mozilla are bringing open, private and multilingual AI to your web browser","Cloudera and Mistral Partner to Bring Specialized, Sovereign Intelligence to Enterprise Data","Modernizing complex legacy code with AI agents."]')
