values ('chip-huyen-personal-blog', 'rss', 'https://huyenchip.com/feed.xml', 'Chip Huyen', 'Personal blog', 'en', 'Chip Huyen is a machine learning engineer and writer who works on bringing AI into production. This is her personal blog: long technical essays on generative AI system design, agents, evaluation and model routing, plus occasional posts on open source AI tooling and personal reflections on growth. Posts are technical deep dives rather than timely news coverage.', 0.1, null, null, '["Common pitfalls when building generative AI applications","Agents","Building A Generative AI Platform"]')
