values ('cursor-product-and-customer-stories', 'website', 'https://cursor.com/blog', 'Cursor', 'Product and customer stories', 'en', 'Cursor is an AI coding assistant and code editor company. This is its blog: customer case studies on teams adopting Cursor, new model integrations such as Grok 4.6, security certifications, infrastructure projects like its open source GPU kernel work, and company milestones. It carries only Cursor''s own posts, not independent tutorials or third party coverage of the product.', 1.5, null, null, '["Introducing Cursor Start","Git at any scale","How Basis builds long-horizon accounting agents with Cursor"]')
