values ('lovable-product-guides', 'website', 'https://lovable.dev/en/guides', 'Lovable', 'Product guides', 'en', 'Lovable is an AI app building platform that turns natural language prompts into working software. This is its guides section: how to articles on running design intake, beta programmes and product roadmaps inside Lovable, plus comparisons against tools such as Base44, Vercel, Replit and Cursor. It teaches workflows for building with Lovable rather than reporting general company news.', null, null, null, '["How to Manage Design Requests: Intake, Triage, and a Visible Queue in One Build","Design Intake Forms vs Slack Requests: How to Choose (and When to Build Your Own)","Best Design System Tools for Small Teams and Startups"]')
