values ('vercel-product-and-platform-news', 'rss', 'https://vercel.com/atom', 'Vercel', 'Product and platform news', 'en', 'Vercel is a cloud platform for building and deploying web applications. This is its news feed: near constant updates on new AI Gateway model additions, deployment and build performance improvements, developer tooling such as the CLI and Sandbox, and infrastructure changes across its platform. It covers Vercel''s own product changes rather than general AI industry news.', 49.4, null, null, '["Spend Management expands to Enterprise Flexible Commitment plans","WebMCP support now available in mcp-handler","v0 now reads npm credentials from shared environment variables"]')
