values ('captain-s-meta-ai-side-hustle-guides', 'rss', 'https://captainsmeta.com/rss.xml', 'Captain''s Meta', 'AI side hustle guides', 'en', 'Captain''s Meta publishes step by step guides for building and scaling businesses with AI and automation. This is its feed: frequent how-to posts on niche AI services and products such as pet portraits, podcast editing, grant writing and real estate photo enhancement, plus roundups of AI tools for specific professions. It focuses on practical business playbooks rather than AI research or product news.', 105, null, null, '["AI Custom Avatars and PFPs: Personal Art at Scale","AI T-Shirt Graphics: Designs That Sell (and Print) Without a Design Degree","AI Podcast Production Service: The Editing Grind Nobody Wants to Do"]')
