values ('marktechpost-ai-research-news', 'rss', 'https://www.marktechpost.com/category/technology/artificial-intelligence/feed/', 'MarkTechPost', 'AI research news', 'en', 'MarkTechPost is an AI research and technology news platform. This is its Artificial Intelligence category feed: new model and tool releases from labs and startups such as Jina AI, Alibaba''s Qwen team, Microsoft and Google Research, open source model drops, benchmark comparisons, and plain language summaries of academic papers on language and vision models. It covers technical releases and papers rather than company business or funding news.', 35, null, null, '["Jina AI Releases jina-ocr-v1: A 3.4B MoE Document Parser With Built-In Speculative Decoding for Low-Budget GPUs","PrismML Releases Ternary Bonsai 2 27B: A 5.9 GB Apache 2.0 Model Retaining 98.2% of Qwen3.8 27B Performance","Alibaba Qwen Releases Qwen3.8-Omni-Flash: A 1M-Context Omni-Modal Model Built Around Agentic Audio-Video Understanding and Tool Use"]')
