values ('aimodels-fyi-ai-research-digest', 'rss', 'https://aimodels.substack.com/feed', 'AIModels.fyi', 'AI research digest', 'en', 'AIModels.fyi is a newsletter that digests new AI research papers and model releases. This is its main feed: plain language write ups explaining what a single paper or model does, covering topics such as agent training, memory systems, model efficiency, tool use and reasoning, plus periodic highlights of specific new open models. It explains individual papers and models rather than reporting general AI company or industry news.', 0.9, null, null, '["OpenAI launches GPT-6 Astra","Transcripts aren''t memory","Can evolutionary search train long-horizon agents without the usual GPU-heavy RL machinery?"]')
