values ('google-research-blog', 'rss', 'https://research.google/blog/rss/', 'Google', 'Research blog', 'en', 'Google is the technology company behind Search, Android and its Gemini AI models. This is its research blog: posts on machine learning methods and generative AI tools for education, algorithms for logistics and search ranking, and applied science work spanning genomics, connectomics, climate monitoring and health sensing such as glucose and cardiometabolic risk. It covers Google''s research output broadly rather than consumer product launches or business news.', 2.8, null, null, '["MilleMiglia: A realistic instance generator for middle-mile logistics","The future of practice: Enabling teachers to create learning interactives with generative UI","Bypassing inference bottlenecks: Accelerating complex AI search with Retrieve-for-Train"]')
