values ('cognition-devin-product-updates', 'rss', 'https://devin.ai/rss.xml', 'Cognition', 'Devin product updates', 'en', 'Cognition is the company that builds the AI coding agent Devin. This is its blog: product launches such as code scanning and macOS support, new model availability inside Devin from providers including OpenAI, Anthropic, Google and xAI, pricing changes, enterprise features like managed plugins, and engineering write ups on how Devin''s own tooling is built. It does not cover AI news outside Cognition''s own product and models it integrates.', 1.8, null, null, '["Introducing Code Scans","Bringing macOS to Devin","Governing AI agents at scale with BlackRock"]')
