values ('nvidia-company-newsroom', 'rss', 'https://nvidianews.nvidia.com/rss.xml', 'NVIDIA', 'Company newsroom', 'en', 'NVIDIA is the company behind CUDA and the GPUs widely used for AI computing. This is its official newsroom feed: product and partnership announcements, executive appearances such as Jensen Huang''s keynotes, data center and AI factory infrastructure stories, gaming updates for GeForce NOW, and features on customers using NVIDIA technology in robotics, healthcare and supply chains. It is company press coverage rather than developer tutorials or technical how to guides.', 14.6, null, null, '["Cute Critters Come to the Cloud: ''Aniimo'' Launches on GeForce NOW","NVIDIA Vera Rubin NVL72 Delivers Leading Performance in MLPerf Inference v6.1 Debut","Emerald AI, Google and NVIDIA Launch Alliance to Advance Flexible AI Data Centers"]')
