values ('langchain-product-and-engineering-blog', 'website', 'https://www.langchain.com/blog', 'LangChain', 'Product and engineering blog', 'en', 'LangChain is the company behind the LangChain and LangGraph frameworks for building AI agents. This is its blog: product updates to LangSmith and its agent tooling, engineering write ups on building multi-agent systems, memory and context handling, and case studies of companies such as Toyota, Vodafone, Schneider Electric and Included Health deploying agents built with its tools. It covers LangChain''s own products and customers rather than general AI industry news.', 4.4, null, null, '["Building a Harness with Jev","Building an Agent Harness for Life Sciences: Introducing Deep Life Sci","How Included Health Built Federated Agents for Healthcare Navigation with Deep Agents and LangGraph"]')
