values ('ethan-mollick-personal-ai-newsletter', 'rss', 'https://www.oneusefulthing.org/feed', 'Ethan Mollick', 'Personal AI newsletter', 'en', 'Ethan Mollick is a Wharton professor who writes about AI''s practical effects on work and life. This is his newsletter: essays on how AI agents and chatbots are changing jobs, education and everyday habits, opinionated guides to choosing between tools like Claude and GPT, and reflections on what new model releases mean for how people work. It is personal analysis and opinion, not company announcements or product news.', 0.3, null, null, '["The Overhang","Agency and Agents","An opinionated guide to which AI to use to do stuff"]')
