values ('ai-news-ai-industry-news', 'rss', 'https://www.artificialintelligence-news.com/feed/', 'AI News', 'AI industry news', 'en', 'AI News is a technology publication covering the artificial intelligence industry. This is its main feed: enterprise AI adoption stories, warehouse and logistics automation, statements from executives at companies such as Microsoft and Anthropic, new startup launches, and analysis of AI regulation and governance. Some items are labelled sponsored content from vendors rather than independent reporting, so treat those separately from its news coverage.', 19.9, null, null, '["Gartner outlines four AI tiers in warehouse automation","Fulcra Brings Universal Multiplayer to Any Agents You Choose","Adecco Group rolls out Agentforce Coworker to 27,000 staff in 40-plus countries"]')
