values ('the-rundown-ai-ai-newsletter-and-tutorials', 'website', 'https://therundown.ai/', 'The Rundown AI', 'AI newsletter and tutorials', 'en', 'The Rundown AI is a media company that publishes an AI newsletter. This is its homepage: short news items on model releases and company moves from labs such as OpenAI and Meta, step by step tutorials on using tools like ChatGPT, OpenRouter and coding agents, and a directory of AI products across categories such as robotics, writing and productivity. It mixes news, how to guides and product listings rather than being a pure news source.', null, null, null, '["Inside OpenAI''s log of misbehaving models","Agility''s new ''safer'' humanoid","Zuck sits out the AI slowdown"]')
