values ('tldr-ai-newsletter', 'rss', 'https://tldr.tech/api/rss/ai', 'TLDR', 'AI newsletter', 'en', 'TLDR is a newsletter company that covers technology topics in short summaries. This is its AI edition: brief links and one line summaries of AI model releases, company announcements and research from names like Claude, Gemini, OpenAI and DeepSeek, aimed at readers who want the headlines without full articles. Each issue links out to original sources rather than containing TLDR''s own full length reporting.', 5.8, null, null, '["Claude Projects v2, Google family agent","Claude + Cowork merge, ChatGPT sponsored agents, harness tax","Jev, Periodic Neon, Gemini 3.8 Live"]')
