values ('newsletter-practical-ai-newsletter', 'website', 'https://newsletter.futurepedia.io/', 'Futurepedia', 'Practical AI newsletter', 'en', 'Futurepedia is a directory of AI tools and courses. This is its practical newsletter: short posts on ChatGPT building a live website from one prompt, Claude Design turning messy notes into a one-page road map, ChatGPT prepping meetings from calendar and inbox, trusted AI research workflows, and roundups of tools such as Suno and Gemini. It is not a model lab changelog or academic paper feed.', null, null, null, '["Sep 15, 2026 • 3 min read ChatGPT 6 Turns One Prompt Into a Live Website Watch it build a working page, fix it mid-task, and publish a link you can share","Sep 8, 2026 • 3 min read Turn Your Messy Notes Into a Clear Road Map The exact Claude Design workflow to turn a rough plan into a clean one-page road map","Sep 1, 2026 • 3 min read Let ChatGPT Prep You, So You Miss Nothing It pulls your calendar, inbox, and notes together so nothing slips before you walk in."]')
