values ('creativeainews-ai-tools-for-creators', 'website', 'https://www.creativeainews.com/', 'Creative AI News', 'AI tools for creators', 'en', 'Creative AI News covers AI tools and workflows for creative professionals. This is its site: deep dives on a coding agent uploading a .git folder, Bend 2 proofs against AI bugs, publishing an AI-narrated audiobook, Wispr Canto dictation error rates, a cheap browser agent, and GitHub Copilot''s Rust port token cost. It is not a vendor product blog or a general tech news wire.', null, null, null, '["ZCode Silently Uploads Your Entire .git Folder","Bend 2 Blocks AI Bugs With Proof. Laws Are the Work","How to Publish an AI-Narrated Audiobook in 2026"]')
