values ('x-deepseek_ai', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/deepseek_ai', 'DeepSeek', 'DeepSeek model releases and API pricing', 'en', 'DeepSeek is a Chinese AI lab that releases open models and sells API access. This is their X account: model launches like DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash and V4-Flash-Vision-Exp, architecture details such as parameter counts and KV cache size, API price changes, and platform features like the Files API and multimodal support. Posts come in threads with bullet lists, several in one day around a release, then weeks of silence. It does not post general industry news or comment on other labs.', null, 0.5, 1135745, '["🌐 Supporting open source. Expanding deployment options.\n\nWe’ll work closely with the open-source com","💰 More efficient architecture. Lower API prices.\n\nV4.1-Flash lets us serve more users at a lower cos","⚡ V4.1-Flash is now live on the DeepSeek API with native multimodal support.\n\nSet your model to deep"]')
