values ('x-dreamina_ai', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/dreamina_ai', 'Dreamina AI', 'AI image and video generation', 'en', 'Dreamina AI is ByteDance''s AI image and video generation tool built on the Seedance models. This is their X account: feature launches on the Dreamina web app such as preview modes and cinematic workflows, creator contests and winner announcements, Discord credit giveaways, discount offers, and short video tutorials made with the tool. It does not cover AI industry news or tools other than Dreamina.', null, 1.7, 27814, '["Look me in the eyes. Same creative magic, now on Dreamina App. Try cast for free 👉https://t.co/CEloH","【Dreamina AI web is LIVE】 Winners Announced! Check if you''re one of the lucky winners! https://t.co/","Dreamina Seedance 2.5 White Model Reference Creation Contest, Winners Announced One white model. In"]')
