values ('x-relume_ai', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/relume_ai', 'Relume', 'AI website builder for agencies', 'en', 'Relume makes an AI website builder and component library used by freelancers and agencies. This is their X account: threads announcing Relume Publish with hosting and specialist AI agents for copy, design and SEO, free Figma kit offers, and occasional design humor. It posts in bursts around launches and can go quiet for weeks. It does not cover AI news outside Relume''s own product.', null, 0.5, 20774, '["What''s the difference between designers charging $25 per website vs $2,500 per website? Comment the ","What if Apple made a burger? https://t.co/omxjFbVnHe","If you build marketing websites for clients, this one was made for you. Build and grow your next cli"]')
