values ('x-svpino', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/svpino', 'Santiago', 'AI engineering lessons and tool reviews', 'en', 'Santiago is a computer scientist who teaches AI and machine learning engineering and posts several times a day. This is his X account: hands-on takes on infrastructure and databases for agents, search APIs, speech and voice isolation, managed coding agents, video generation tools, and medical uses of AI, often as sponsored partner posts with a personal verdict. It does not cover company earnings or AI policy.', null, 4.8, 456202, '["New database guarantees for agentic workflows: 1. Branches: Give agents a separate version of the da","This is, literally, the best search API for your agents. No other Search API tool scores in the top ","Here is how you can save a ton of money on infrastructure. Best part: you don''t need to commit for a"]')
