values ('x-digitalocean', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/digitalocean', 'DigitalOcean', 'cloud infrastructure for AI agents', 'en', 'DigitalOcean is a cloud provider positioning itself around AI workloads. This is their X account: new models available on its serverless inference such as OpenAI, NVIDIA and TypeSafe releases, its Managed Agents preview, tutorials on running and sandboxing agents, speaker announcements for its own summits, and meetups. It does not cover consumer AI products or industry news beyond its platform and partners.', null, 4.5, 225925, '["Now available: @nvidia Nemotron™ 3 Diarization on DigitalOcean Serverless Inference. Open-weight str","Jev doesn''t write text. It returns a typed decision in 70–500ms: is this spam, which queue, what sco","Join us for the night shift after @AIconference. Your agents aren''t failing because of the model. Th"]')
