values ('x-runwayml', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/runwayml', 'Runway', 'generative image and video tools', 'en', 'Runway is an AI company building image and video generation models and tools. This is their X account: new features and third-party models as they become available in the app, an MCP for using Runway inside Claude, evaluation write-ups, and affiliate program calls, usually as a headline post followed by a link post. It does not cover coding tools or AI industry news.', null, 8.6, 292224, '["Get started: https://t.co/YXqYR7AGMo","Claude Opus 5.5 meets Runway MCP. Connect Runway directly into Claude to generate polished images an","Try today: https://t.co/qKmmiG0q1x"]')
