values ('x-claudeai', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/claudeai', 'Claude', 'Claude product launches', 'en', 'Claude is the official account for Anthropic''s Claude assistant. This is their X account: launches such as Claude Opus 5.5 and the Claude Marketplace for connectors, plugins and agents, plus roundups of what people have built with new models, often as threads with links. Posts are product-facing and about Claude only. It does not cover Anthropic research papers or other AI assistants.', null, 5.4, 1823342, '["What are you going to explore with Opus 5.5 this weekend?","https://t.co/3kIQ5LKes3","https://t.co/7zcjE09JYh"]')
