values ('x-fabrizioromano', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/FabrizioRomano', 'Fabrizio Romano', 'European transfer wire', 'en', 'Fabrizio Romano is a transfer journalist who posts breaking football news in English for a global audience. This is their X account: contract talks and transfer developments across Europe''s top leagues (Bayern and Manchester City in the sampled posts), quotes from managers and players, and official confirmations tagged OFFICIAL or Here we go, posted around nine times a day. It covers every major European club and national team rather than any one club.', null, 9, 29134273, '["🚨 Bayern’s Karl-Heinz Rummenigge: “Olise is under contract until 2029”. “At some point, the club wil","🚨 Rodri on Manchester City charges: “The club always press their confidence that they never did some","🚨 Rodri on Manchester City charges: “What we did, they cannot take it out of us. It''s something that"]')
