values ('x-mattemoretto', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/MatteMoretto', 'Matteo Moretto', 'Spanish and Italian transfer market', 'es', 'Matteo Moretto is a Spanish-based transfer reporter who works with Fabrizio Romano. This is their X account: coaching changes in Spain (Cádiz weighing a change of manager), done deals in Italy (Neto to Juventus) and club-structure news (Milan under Cardinale), written in Spanish and Italian. It covers the whole Spanish and Italian market rather than a single club.', null, 2.3, 573607, '["El Cádiz se está planteando seriamente cambiar de entrenador, el club ya está en contacto con varios","È fatta per Neto alla Juventus. Accordo chiuso. https://t.co/hNcDO02q0U","Milan: Gerry Cardinale è al lavoro per migliorare la struttura del club. Il proprietario, in collabo"]')
