values ('x-martinezferran', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/martinezferran', 'Ferran Martínez', 'Barcelona first team and Spain squad', 'ca', 'Ferran Martínez is a Mundo Deportivo journalist who follows FC Barcelona and the Spain national team. This is their X account: Barcelona first-team news and player interviews for Mundo Deportivo (Fermín''s return to the Spain squad), match reaction on players such as Raphinha, and opinion on Real Madrid and Mourinho, in Catalan and Spanish. Posts arrive several times a week. It covers Barcelona and Spain; other clubs appear only as opponents or through Mourinho.', null, 0.6, 42491, '["Fermín vuelve a la selección y atiende a @mundodeportivo https://t.co/5SfgORASBt","Mourinho vuelve a hablar de árbitros porque no puede hablar de fútbol. Mal diagnóstico Qué larga se ","EL PROTAGONISTA Raphinha està disposat a marcar una època al Barça. Quina irrupció com a ''9''! 😳 http"]')
