values ('x-mundodeportivo', 'x_account', 'https://x.com/mundodeportivo', 'Mundo Deportivo', 'Catalan sports daily, Barcelona-heavy', 'es', 'Mundo Deportivo is a Barcelona-based sports newspaper founded in 1906. This is their X account: a dense stream of article links in Spanish covering FC Barcelona football and basketball, opinion columns on the club, Real Madrid stories, plus tennis, cycling and motorsport, ten or more posts a day. It is a general sports daily with a Barcelona lean, covering every sport the paper follows rather than one club.', null, 10, 3095122, '["Davidovich debuta en China con victoria ante el último verdugo de Sinner ✍️ @ivanronda https://t.co/","🏀 Hambre de Liga: el Barça se estrena en el Palau ante el recién ascendido Leyma ✍️ @jfelipo https:/","''El anti-Barça'' ✍️ #OpiniónMD de @AlexisRacionero https://t.co/6jfsToEMiO"]')
